  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Luo Zu and Luo Ran pay respects to Wu Yong as Lord Alliance Leader. Narration names Luo Zu the current first supreme elder of Luo clan and a person of authority, while Luo Ran is a space path general with peak rank seven battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "fac_luo_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Luo Ran wear Luo clan’s signature attire: deep green short sleeve shirts, long black pants, and jade colored leg bindings.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He explains that Luo clan found Qi Jue grotto-heaven while exploring white heaven, entered its central area with the qi tides, and then lost a fight to variant human Gu Immortals led by Xiao He Jian. Luo clan asks the Southern Alliance for help because it cannot take the grotto-heaven alone.",
      "chapters": [
        1997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeat-and-aid-request",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qi_jue_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_xiao_he_jian",
        "fac_southern_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the grotto-heaven he later blames Wu Shuai for destruction that drives Qi Jue grotto-heaven berserk.",
      "chapters": [
        1999
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "defeat-and-aid-request",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_shuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a clan meeting he keeps Luo Ran behind, apologizes for the burden, and says Luo clan must keep contacting Immortal Crane Sect in secret while he worries about the clan’s safety.",
      "chapters": [
        2219
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "secret-contacts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    }
  ],
